WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:04.040
Just being at your side,

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:16.160
Gentles my hearts to the point of disbelief

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:25.570
I thought I heard the sound of your footsteps behind me,

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:35.720
I turned my head repeatedly, wishing you would appear...

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:41.740
...and then there you were

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:50.990
The beginning of a new love

00:00:51.310 --> 00:01:05.870
Is unknowingly, the beginning of our invisible love story

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:15.360
Hence, I shall never leave your side

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.540
I pledge to love you and only you

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:36.860
Isn't your house around there?

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:39.130
Mine's over there.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:44.930
Maybe that's the kindergarten we went to.

00:01:46.010 --> 00:01:49.740
I fell off the slide there once.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.110
That caused such a fuss.

00:01:53.550 --> 00:02:00.280
Akemi joined our class then. She was with us until middle school...

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:08.300
Don't look at me!

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:16.230
<i>That day, holding each other's</i> <i>hand tightly...</i>

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:21.470
<i>slowly, we climbed</i> <i>Observation Hill.</i>

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:26.140
<i>That way, we knew</i> <i>we could be together.</i>

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:32.750
<i>Even when we reached the top,</i> <i>and looked out over the city...</i>

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:35.260
w<i>e still kept holding hands.</i>

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:40.830
<i>We didn't let go.</i>

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:48.660
"Together, Alone"

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:57.470
My heart doesn't make a sound anymore...

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:00.880
even though it's always pounding.

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:04.210
I'm so ashamed of being like this.

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:09.220
I wish I could go away and disappear.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:13.860
But, even though I'm like this...

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.900
I'm sorry, but I'm still in love.

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:19.060
I'm sorry.

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.870
I want to live!

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.270
Someday...

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:31.510
do you think we'll be able to look out over the city like this again?

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:34.810
Chise?

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:39.280
Me, you, and our kids will go out...

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:42.320
for a nice dinner...

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:46.430
and I'll want to show them this place too!

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:51.290
But when we get here...

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:55.700
I'll forget about the kids...

00:03:57.410 --> 00:04:02.270
and say, "Remember that time we came here..."

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:08.670
"and how we got kind of passionate?"

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.580
And we'll laugh...

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:16.420
at all the troubles we thought we had...

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:19.960
and how they were really nothing.

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:25.000
But then we'll say, "Look at us now. Here we are."

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:29.460
I love you, Chise.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:35.370
Let's live together, somewhere no one knows us.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.450
I can hear...

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.490
your heart beating.

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:49.450
Your heart sounds different than other people's.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:53.090
Did you know that, Shuji?

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.290
It's cute.

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:58.130
I like it.

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:10.940
<i>As we came down the hill,</i> <i>we talked about our plans...</i>

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:13.510
<i>how we'd both get jobs...</i>

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:17.480
<i>save our money to buy a car...</i>

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:21.060
<i>and how we'd run</i> <i>if they found us.</i>

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:33.400
I'll be waiting there.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:35.760
I'll be waiting.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:52.980
<i>So we arranged to meet in</i> <i>two hours at the station.</i>

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.920
<i>Then we went our separate ways.</i>

